  "id": "LAW-0470",
  "slug": "contract-formation-08-mechanism",
  "title": "Capacity of the parties, without a rule — party cards unfold their supplied attributes, on two lanes",
  "titleEs": "Capacidad de las partes — Mecanismo o relación explicada",
  "category": "contract-formation",
  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Capacidad de las partes",
  "treatment": "mechanism",
  "family": "spatial-mechanism",
  "description": "A time-lane diagram: Party A's lane and Party B's lane, the supplied order running along both. Each party's card (● Party A's, ◆ Party B's, at equal weight) runs on its solid line from its sender's lane to the other lane; the events are marked with their fictional time labels. Once the relationships are drawn the cards unfold and show their supplied attributes (generic and fictional). Only supplied relationships are drawn; a tracer follows the supplied traversal order and the focus element swells. A supplied status \"capacity pending verification\" shows a dashed pending ring round the indicated card and a footer chip — a pending state only. No rule on capacity and no legal effect is stated.",
  "tags": [
    "party card",
    "attributes",
    "unfold",
    "pending verification",
    "lanes",
    "sequence",
    "relations",
    "tracer"
  ],
